🌍 Language Translation Tool
📌 About the Project
The Language Translation Tool is a simple web-based application developed using HTML, CSS and JavaScript. It helps users translate text from one language to another using a translation API.

The main aim of this project is to make communication easier by reducing language barriers.
✨ Features
- Translate text between multiple languages.
- Select source and target languages.
- Swap source and target languages.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.
- Display translated text instantly.
- Copy translated text to the clipboard.
🛠️ Technologies Used
- HTML: Used to create the structure of the webpage.
- CSS: Used to design and style the application.
- JavaScript: Used to implement the functionality.
- MyMemory Translation API: Used to translate text between languages.
🌐 Languages Supported
- English
- Kannada
- Hindi
- Tamil
- Telugu
- French
- Spanish
- Marathi
⚙️ How to Run the Project
1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open index.html in your browser.
4. Enter the text you want to translate.
5. Select the source and target languages.
6. Click the Translate button.
7. View and copy the translated text.
📸 Project Output
The application provides a simple interface with:
- Text input section.
- Language selection options.
- Translate button.
- Translated output section.
- Copy text option.
- Swap language option.
🎯 Objective
The objective of this project is to develop a simple and useful translation application that helps people communicate across different languages.
